  "justification": [
    "674152 little-endian is 68 49 0a (hI newline); 682344 is 68 69 0a (hi newline). The intended expected stdout is unchanged.",
    "Bare bool literals and integer constants are folded by the existing frontend before intrinsic type checking. Official compiler SHA62bc0f97c4cd9c7f8230bd3af765487626e06bc3918e2c67e35dc058390bc1fd compiled all eight exact original zero-count sources through MLIR CPU; every resulting executable exited0 with empty stdout/stderr. No parser/type semantics changed.",
    "Original author1 results and const-origin-before predictions are retained as failures; this version does not rewrite those outcomes. Typed bool, unsigned/narrow variables, floating values, raw pointers and aggregates still retain separate refusal controls."
  ],
  "reference_runtime_results_sha256": "290eaf45ac0b4e43b9ad4b4713455d94eb5febd414ab6fe83966f6fdb861bc07",
